# M17: the copy of a document that was open when the last session stopped is offered back at launch. The old QUILL.RCV in the central
# folder is the copy; the question has Recover, Discard and Later, Tab and the arrow keys move between them and a letter presses one.
# Recover opens the copy as the untitled document with its text.
@recovery
@copy quill.rcv RECOVER\
@stamp RECOVER\QUILL.RCV 2025-01-01 00:00
tab right left        # Discard, Later, Discard
left                  # Recover
r                     # Recover: the text of the copy is on the screen
